, "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 26, "prompt": "You hear members of a hospital committee discussing problems in the X-ray department.\nThe problems are due to a delay in\nA. buying a replacement machine.\nB. getting approval for a repair to a machine.\nC. identifying a problem with a particular machine.", "sourcePage": 68, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 27, "prompt": "You hear a senior nurse giving feedback to a trainee after a training exercise.\nThe trainee accepts that he failed to\nA. locate the CPR board quickly enough.\nB. deal with the CPR board on his own.\nC. install the CPR board correctly.", "sourcePage": 68, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 28, "prompt": "You hear a trainee nurse asking his senior colleague about the use of anti-embolism\nsocks (AES) for a patient.\nThe patient isn't wearing the socks because\nA. she's suffering from arterial disease in her legs.\nB. there is sensory loss in her legs.\nC. her legs are too swollen.", "sourcePage": 69, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 29, "prompt": "You hear a vet talking about her involvement in the management of the practice\nwhere she works.\nHow does she feel about her role?\nA. She accepts that it's become surprisingly complex.\nB. She wishes her boss took more interest in the finances.\nC. She values the greater understanding it gives her of her work.", "sourcePage": 69, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 30, "prompt": "You hear a physiotherapist giving a presentation about a study she's been involved\nin.\nShe suggests that her findings are of particular interest because of\nA. the age of the subjects.\nB. the type of disorder involved.\nC. the length of time covered by the study.", "sourcePage": 69, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["dc084db955f1fd0c226c791ad34003e8644a0ea2cc0f8d9ac5a2d2a05ff5c622"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
